---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms — Angel0x1" description="Terms for the Angel0x1 waitlist and early access.">
  <main class="wrap legal">
    <a href="/" class="eyebrow back">← Back</a>
    <h1 class="h2 italic">Terms</h1>
    <p class="soft">
      These terms cover this website and the Angel0x1 waitlist while the app is in
      development. Full app terms will accompany the App Store release.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h3 italic">Waitlist &amp; early access</h2>
    <p class="soft">
      Joining the waitlist places no obligation on you and costs nothing. The
      first 5&nbsp;000 people to join are eligible for free lifetime access to the
      app once it launches. "Lifetime" means the lifetime of the product, on the
      account tied to the email you register. This offer is limited, non-transferable,
      and may be adjusted if abused (e.g. duplicate or automated signups).
    </p>

    <h2 class="h3 italic">No warranty yet</h2>
    <p class="soft">
      Angel0x1 is pre-release software under active development. Features, timelines,
      and the roadmap on this site are aspirational and may change.
    </p>

    <p class="eyebrow faint updated">Last updated {new Date().getFullYear()}</p>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { max-width: 720px; padding-block: 140px 100px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
  .legal h2 { margin-top: 22px; }
  .back { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .updated { margin-top: 30px; }
</style>
